{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":58,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["真正的虔诚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“你要高声呼喊，不要停止；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要放声高呼，像响亮的号角。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要向我的子民宣告他们的过犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向雅各家宣告他们的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们天天寻求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乐于认识我的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像没有丢弃他们上帝法令的正义之邦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们向我求公义的判决，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"似乎乐于到我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说，‘我们禁食，你为什么不看呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们刻苦己身，你为什么不理睬呢？’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说，‘看啊，禁食之日你们仍然随心所欲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"压榨你们的工人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们一面禁食，一面争闹打斗，恶拳相向。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"今天这种禁食不能使你们的祷告在高天蒙垂听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道这是我要的让人刻苦己身的禁食日吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道像芦苇一样垂着头、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在麻布和炉灰上就是禁食吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这就是你们所谓的禁食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所谓的蒙耶和华悦纳的日子吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“‘我要的禁食岂不是，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去邪恶的锁链，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解开轭上的绳索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折断一切的轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使受欺压的人得到自由吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不是把你们的食物分给饥饿的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接待无家可归的穷人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"送衣服给赤身露体的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不躲避求助的亲人吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们这样做，你们的光必如晨光照耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的创伤必迅速痊愈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的公义必在前引路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的荣耀必在后面保护你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们求告，耶和华必应允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们呼求，耶和华必回应。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们不再欺压、指责和毁谤，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们给饥饿的人食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使困苦的人得饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的光必照亮黑暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的黑夜必变成正午。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必不断地引导你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们在干旱之地得到饱足，筋骨强健。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必像灌溉充足的园子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像涌流不息的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必重修古老的荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建远古的根基。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必被称为修补断垣、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建居民街道的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"“‘如果你们遵守安息日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的圣日不做私事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以安息日为乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尊崇耶和华的圣日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不随意行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不妄自说话，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必以耶和华为乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必使你们在地上受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并享用你们先祖雅各的产业。’”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲口说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/58.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/59.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/57.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}